before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int double_value(int x) { return x * 2; }
int plus_one(int x) { return x + 1; }
int apply(int value, int (*operation)(int)) { return operation(value); }
int main(void) {
 printf("%d\n", apply(4, double_value));
}
```

